<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">CHECK / OUTPUT</view><view class="title">预览与输出</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{!business}}" class="card empty">请先创建或选择业务<button class="primary" style="margin-top:24rpx" bindtap="create">前往业务列表</button></view><block wx:else><view class="notice">生成的是可编辑 Word 抬头草稿，不含货物明细；尚未进行完整信用证合规审查。</view><view class="card"><view class="row"><view class="name grow">{{business.name}}</view><button class="link" data-step="1" bindtap="edit">编辑</button></view><view class="label">预览单据</view><picker range="{{docNames}}" value="{{docIndex}}" bindchange="changeDoc"><view class="select">{{docNames[docIndex]}}<text>›</text></view></picker><view class="row" style="margin-top:20rpx"><view class="muted">{{templateName}}</view><button class="link" bindtap="templates">选择字段模板</button></view></view><view class="card"><view class="section">选择本次输出单据</view><view class="check"><switch color="#176b52" checked="{{invoiceSelected}}" data-doc="invoice" bindchange="toggleDoc"/><text>发票</text></view><view class="check"><switch color="#176b52" checked="{{packingSelected}}" data-doc="packingList" bindchange="toggleDoc"/><text>装箱单</text></view><view class="meta">可同时选择两份；下方检查会按所选单据提示缺失内容。</view></view>
<view class="card output-card"><view class="row"><view class="section" style="margin:0">最终输出结果</view><text class="tag">{{latestOutputs.length ? latestOutputs.length + ' 份文件' : '尚未生成'}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{!latestOutputs.length}}" class="meta">核对完成后点击下方“一键生成所选单据”，文件会显示在这里。</view><view wx:for="{{latestOutputs}}" wx:key="id" class="history"><view class="row"><view class="output-name grow">{{item.docName}}抬头 · Word</view><text class="tag {{item.stale ? 'warn' : ''}}">{{item.stale ? '历史版本' : '当前版本'}}</text></view><view class="meta">信用证号：{{item.lcNumber || '未填写'}}</view><view class="meta">发票号：{{item.invoiceNumber || '未填写'}}</view><view class="meta">生成时间：{{item.date}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.stale}}" class="fieldnote">业务信息已修改，请重新生成。</view><view class="actions"><button class="primary" data-path="{{item.path}}" bindtap="openHistory">打开 Word</button><button data-path="{{item.path}}" bindtap="saveOutput">保存/转发</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{latestOutputs.length}}" class="meta">文件保存在本机；可用“保存/转发”发送到微信文件传输助手或会话留存。</view></view>
<view class="card"><view class="row"><view class="section" style="margin:0">生成检查</view><text class="tag {{issues.length ? 'warn' : ''}}">{{issues.length ? issues.length + ' 项待处理' : '已完成'}}</text></view><button wx:for="{{issues}}" wx:key="index" class="link" style="text-align:left;white-space:normal" data-step="{{item.step}}" bindtap="edit">{{item.text}} ›</button><view wx:if="{{!issues.length}}" class="meta">当前单据必填信息完整且已核对。</view></view><button class="primary" disabled="{{issues.length > 0 || generating}}" loading="{{generating}}" bindtap="generate">一键生成所选单据</button><view class="meta">生成的是可编辑 Word 抬头草稿；结果区可直接打开或保存/转发。</view><view class="paper"><view class="muted" style="margin-bottom:20rpx">HEADER DRAFT / 抬头草稿</view><view class="paper-title">{{docIndex === 0 ? 'COMMERCIAL INVOICE' : 'PACKING LIST'}}</view><view class="paper-label">SELLER</view><view class="paper-value">{{document.fields.seller || '待填写'}}</view><view class="paper-label">BUYER</view><view class="paper-value">{{document.fields.buyer || '待填写'}}</view><block wx:if="{{docIndex === 0 || document.fields.invoiceNumber}}"><view class="paper-label">INVOICE NO.</view><view class="paper-value">{{document.fields.invoiceNumber || '待填写'}}</view></block><block wx:if="{{docIndex === 0 || document.fields.invoiceDate}}"><view class="paper-label">DATE</view><view class="paper-value">{{document.fields.invoiceDate || '待填写'}}</view></block><block wx:if="{{document.fields.lcNumber}}"><view class="paper-label">L/C NO.</view><view class="paper-value">{{document.fields.lcNumber}}</view></block><view class="divider"/><view class="paper-label">ADDITIONAL REFERENCES</view><view wx:for="{{document.printedClauses}}" wx:key="id" class="paper-value" style="margin-top:16rpx">{{item.name}}：{{item.value || '待补充'}}</view><view wx:if="{{!document.printedClauses.length}}" class="meta">无额外条款</view></view><view wx:if="{{document.checklist.length}}" class="card"><view class="section">操作要求（不写入抬头）</view><view wx:for="{{document.checklist}}" wx:key="id" class="source">{{item.name}}：{{item.value}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{olderOutputs.length}}" class="card" style="margin-top:28rpx"><view class="section">更早的输出文件</view><view wx:for="{{olderOutputs}}" wx:key="id" class="history"><view class="row"><view class="grow"><view>{{item.docName}}抬头 · {{item.date}}</view><view class="fieldnote" wx:if="{{item.stale}}">业务已修改，此文件为历史版本</view></view><button class="link" data-path="{{item.path}}" bindtap="openHistory">打开</button></view></view></view></block></view>
